    <informations>Shelly 2L Gen4 — schematic symbol.
Terminals, left to right as printed: O2 S2 L O1 S1 Sx.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-2l-gen4
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_f3afcced7f1cfba6e36cf9013eda74dc2d61064d642e15270489e87971eda2eb/Shelly-2L-Gen4.jpg?cb=fdf708a0cd92c591a2898cc1bdda1d0d
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_701387eea946fd54d0ddb33b2096126460dd5a432c6dfa0d80a8ebf7f0663e21/2L-Gen3-internal-schematics.png?cb=c8835d113a6d931c838644db8a01289d
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_2afb3133e08defa92d04e82585d2472377d2338033379c910db8f767e28c9a9a/Shelly%202L%20Gen4%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf

Notes:
- No neutral screw. Housing H41.2×W42.2×D16mm differs fromGen3.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
